      "id": "q_001",
      "question": "Which probate or estate record names Caroline Voss's father?",
      "rationale": "Caroline Voss was born in 1839 in Rowan County, North Carolina, and married circa 1858 (the only other dated fact about her). No record found so far names her father. A father's probate or estate file could be created anytime from Caroline's infancy to roughly 60 years after her birth — as late as approximately 1899 — regardless of when Caroline herself married or where she later lived. The search window must not be capped at or near her own 1858 marriage.",
